    "6:00 am in inn: June reaches the square. Ellis says: June, I am heading to the square now to set up for the early shot. Ellis leaves the inn. You see Ellis at the square. You see Cal at the square.",
    "9:30 am in square: June spends the period at the square. Ellis says: Cal, frame the bandstand from that angle; June, keep the switcher quiet until we're live. Ellis looks around. Cal says: Ellis, June, did we get a clean shot of the bandstand setup earlier? I'm double-checking my memory against what's in front of us. Cal looks around.",
    "1:00 pm in square: June spends the period at the square. Ellis says: Cal, keep the lens rolling, but I'm going to hold this mic up and listen to see if the band's audio is clean enough to use live. Ellis stays for the band's cornet solo. Cal says: I'll hold position here. June, keep me updated on the switcher status; I'm trying to catch a good angle on the soloist. Cal spends the period at the square. June invites Cal on the crew radio to contribute to the evening slot."
